# Ship LF in the repository and in the checkout.
#
# The plugin is installed by linking the working directory into a host profile,
# and the host evaluates client.js directly. An autocrlf checkout would rewrite
# every file to CRLF: diffs then show whole-file rewrites, and the published tarball
# would no longer match the tree the tests ran against.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
